 ## 4.0.0 (2024-07-24)
 
 ### Breaking Changes
 
-- `onSelectionChange` prop has been renamed to `onChangeSelection` and its argument has been updated to be a list of ids.
-- `setSelection` prop has been removed. Please use `onChangeSelection` instead.
